WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come into Plow Pose with the toes toward the floor behind you.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the knees and lower them toward the floor beside the ears.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Wrap the arms around the backs of the knees if comfortable, or keep hands on the back.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rest the weight on the shoulders — never on the neck.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Straighten the legs back to Plow, then roll down slowly.
